<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Matthew’s house and at his table,</l><l>Jesus was there to eat with all the sinners.</l><l>Strong ones don’t need a physician,</l><l>He came for those who are ill.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus said to His disciples:</l><l>The harvest is great but the workers are so few!</l><l>Pray to the Lord of the harvest</l><l>To send out workers, yes, do!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
